# GRUB SHIFT: a tour of the other tools. HUSTLE recharges on a squash,
# RECHARGE refreshes its neighbours, BOOST stretches ZAP, DIG opens a pit
# next to a pit, QUAKE hits around a pit, HAIL hits every planter, CRACK blows
# up an egg, FLIP swaps heights and GATHER scoops pods.
game grubshift
wait 5
cheat contract 1 7
cheat clear
cheat chip 0 10
cheat hole 4 2
cheat bug 3 2 1 0
cheat use 0 3 2
expect kills == 1
expect spent0 == 0
cheat clear
cheat chip 1 36
cheat use 0 3 2
cheat use 2 4 2
expect spent0 == 1
cheat use 1 4 2
expect spent0 == 0
expect spent2 == 0
cheat clear
cheat chip 3 30
cheat use 3 2 2
expect fx & 2
cheat bug 5 2 1 0
cheat use 5 5 2
expect kills == 2
cheat clear
cheat chip 4 31
cheat hole 0 0
cheat bug 1 1 1 0
cheat use 4 1 1
expect hole_at11 == 1
expect kills == 3
cheat clear
cheat chip 6 19
cheat hole 5 4
cheat bug 4 3 1 0
cheat bug 5 3 6 0
cheat use 6 5 4
expect kills == 5
cheat clear
cheat chip 5 21
cheat elev 0 0 1
cheat elev 5 4 1
cheat bug 0 0 1 0
cheat bug 5 4 3 0
cheat use 5 2 2
expect kills == 7
cheat clear
cheat chip 2 22
cheat bug 5 0 1 3
cheat bug 4 0 3 0
cheat use 2 5 0
expect eggs == 0
expect kills == 8
cheat clear
cheat chip 0 37
cheat elev 0 0 1
cheat use 0 2 2
expect elev_at00 == 0
expect elev_at11 == 1
cheat clear
cheat chip 1 27
cheat pods 5 4 2
cheat pods 4 4 1
cheat pods 4 3 1
cheat energy 0
cheat use 1 5 4
expect energy == 4
